flowchart TD
    A([Start]) --> B[Initialize session score if absent]
    B --> C[Show move selector and Play round button]
    C --> D{Button clicked?}
    D -- No --> J[Show last round and score]
    D -- Yes --> E[Choose random computer move]
    E --> F[Call determine_winner]
    F --> K[Increase player, computer, or tie score once]
    K --> L[Save both moves and result]
    L --> J
    J --> M([Wait for next interaction])
